        "correctOptionId": "c",
        "explanation": { "en": "Solving BODMAS: Inner bracket gives 4/6 = 2/3. Multiplied by 1/3 gives 2/9. 2/5 - 2/9 = 8/45. 7/9 / (8/45) = 7/9 * 45/8 = 35/8. 25/3 - 35/8 = (200 - 105)/24 = 95/24." }
